{"resourceIdentifier":"2692","resourceName":"Aonong AWMS GHG Mitigation Project in Fujian Province","description":"The project introduces new animal waste management systems to treat the manure from 9 swine farms in Fujian Province. Each subsidiary swine farm will install one animal waste management system, and the manure is treated on site. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons. \r\nThe project activity uses flushing system to collect the manure automatically. All the manure and wastewater are collected and then be separated first. The solid will be treated in aerobic composting system and the organic fertilizers will be produced, most of the fertilizer is distributed to local farmers for free and only a small portion will be sold on the domestic market. The liquid will be treated through anaerobic digestion and the biogas generated during the treatment process will be captured for electricity generation. The sludge produced from anaerobic digestion will be treated through aerobic composting together with the solid, the effluent will be supplied to the farmers living around free for agriculture irrigation.\r\nThe project activity will reduce of GHG in the atmosphere through avoiding methane emissions from anaerobic treatment of swine manure and wastewater.","location":{"latitude":24.247100,"longitude":118.827700},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-01-04","endExclusive":"2022-02-04","endInclusive":"2022-02-03"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2692"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Aonong Biological Technology Group Incorporation Limited"},{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"18217426814"},{"type":"string","value":"119912698@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2692"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"451807"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"China Certification Center, Inc."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"11/01/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/05/2020 - 30/04/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=57152&IDKEY=40e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9s78812608","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Aonong AWMS GHG Mitigation Project in Fujian Province-22102021.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-10-22T06:45:25.473Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=59643&IDKEY=akjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909982247697","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"PD-Aonong AWMS GHG Mitigation Project in Fujian Province-Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-01-04T16:02:23.427Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82472&IDKEY=liquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfe113728888","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"PDD2692c.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-11T15:44:06.54Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63902&IDKEY=k0e98hfal